### Test Listing Status Check

### 1. Guest tạo booking cho listing active (thành công)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": "{{activeListingId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2024-02-15",
  "checkOutDate": "2024-02-17",
  "guests": 2,
  "infants": 0,
  "specialRequests": "Yêu cầu dọn phòng sớm"
}

### 2. Guest tạo booking cho listing inactive (thất bại)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": "{{inactiveListingId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2024-02-15",
  "checkOutDate": "2024-02-17",
  "guests": 2,
  "infants": 0
}

### 3. Guest tạo booking cho listing draft (thất bại)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": "{{draftListingId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2024-02-15",
  "checkOutDate": "2024-02-17",
  "guests": 2,
  "infants": 0
}

### 4. Staff tạo booking cho listing inactive (thành công)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/staff/create
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "listingId": "{{inactiveListingId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2024-02-15",
  "checkOutDate": "2024-02-17",
  "guests": 2,
  "guest_name": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "guest_email": "guest@example.com"
}

### 5. Guest check availability cho listing active
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/availability/{{activeListingId}}?checkIn=2024-02-15&checkOut=2024-02-17

### 6. Guest check availability cho listing inactive
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/availability/{{inactiveListingId}}?checkIn=2024-02-15&checkOut=2024-02-17

### 7. Guest lấy thông tin listing active
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{activeListingId}}

### 8. Guest lấy thông tin listing inactive (thất bại)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{inactiveListingId}}

### 9. Staff lấy thông tin listing inactive (thành công)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{inactiveListingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 10. Guest lấy danh sách listings (chỉ active)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings

### 11. Staff lấy danh sách listings (tất cả trạng thái)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 12. Guest lấy top rated listings (chỉ active)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/top-rated

### 13. Guest lấy top viewed listings (chỉ active)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/top-viewed

### 14. Guest lấy top wishlist listings (chỉ active)
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/top-wishlist

### Variables cho test
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# @guestToken = your_guest_jwt_token_here
# @staffToken = your_staff_jwt_token_here
# @activeListingId = your_active_listing_id_here
# @inactiveListingId = your_inactive_listing_id_here
# @draftListingId = your_draft_listing_id_here
# @propertyId = your_property_id_here 